在する海上自衛隊江田島地区の特別警備隊・幹部候補生学校・第1術科学校と、山口県に所在する海上自衛隊岩国航空基地を訪問しました。 https://t.co/DmLVhefOMH","id_str":"2096941060740260047","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":6,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":116,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"268732024"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwOTY5NDEwNjA2NzMxNTA5NzY=","text":"9月7日、小泉防衛大臣は、広島県に所在する海上自衛隊江田島地区の特別警備隊・幹部候補生学校・第1術科学校と、山口県に所在する海上自衛隊岩国航空基地を訪問しました。\n \n施設や訓練展示などを視察するとともに、日々の任務や教育訓練などに従事する隊員・学生や御家族と交流し、敬意と感謝を伝えました🤝"}}},"rest_id":"2096941060740260047","source":"<a href=\"http://twitter.com/#!/download/ipad\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter for iPad</a>","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"48190","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2096941060740260047","sortIndex":"2097182500219518937"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineModule","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}}},"displayType":"VerticalConversation","entryType":"TimelineTimelineModule","items":[{"entryId":"list-conversation-2097182500219519016-tweet-2096921832612110833","item":{"clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":2},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1082102533454102528/HXpr1ZEl_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/303730149/1782867128"},"core":{"created_at":"Mon May 23 10:17:04 +0000 2011","name":"外務省","screen_name":"MofaJapan_jp"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"VXNlcjozMDM3MzAxNDk=","is_blue_verified":false,"location":{"location":"東京都千代田区"},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":true},"notifications_settings":{"notifications_enabled":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"None","pinned_items":{"tweet_ids_str":["2095650141558768004"]},"possibly_sensitive":false,"privacy":{"protected":false},"profile_bio":{"description":"外務省の公式アカウントです。外交に関する新着情報を中心に発信しております。｜英語版（English）@MofaJapan_en\n｜外務省ソーシャルメディア一覧： https://t.co/2VDfT2CQ5p","entities":{"description":{"urls":[{"display_url":"mofa.go.jp/mofaj/annai/sn…","expanded_url":"https://www.mofa.go.jp/mofaj/annai/sns/list_jp.html","indices":[81,104],"url":"https://t.co/2VDfT2CQ5p"}]},"url":{"urls":[{"display_url":"mofa.go.jp/mofaj/","expanded_url":"http://www.mofa.go.jp/mofaj/","indices":[0,23],"url":"https://t.co/42AYao2vk0"}]}}},"profile_description_language":"ja","profile_image_shape":"Square","profile_metadata":{"profile_interstitial_type":""},"profile_translation":{"translator_type":"none"},"relationship_counts":{"followers":586916,"following":205},"relationship_perspectives":{"blocked_by":false,"blocking":false,"followed_by":false,"following":false,"live_following":false,"muting":false},"rest_id":"303730149","super_follow_eligible":false,"super_followed_by":false,"super_following":false,"tweet_counts":{"media_tweets":20133,"tweets":48790},"verification":{"verified":false,"verified_type":"Government"},"website":{"url":"https://t.co/42AYao2vk0"}}}},"edit_control":{"edit_tweet_ids":["2096921832612110833"],"editable_until_msecs":"1788783698000","edits_remaining":"5","is_edit_eligible":false},"grok_analysis_button":true,"grok_annotations":{"is_image_editable_by_grok":false},"grok_translated_post_with_availability":{"is_available":false},"is_translatable":false,"legacy":{"bookmark_count":695,"bookmarked":false,"conversation_id_str":"2096921832612110833","created_at":"Mon Sep 07 11:21:38 +0000 2026","display_text_range":[0,41],"entities":{},"favorite_count":13385,"favorited":false,"full_text":"駐日中国大使館は、国連憲章のいわゆる「旧敵国条項」等に関する発信を再び行いました。","id_str":"2096921832612110833","is_quote_status":true,"lang":"ja","quote_count":266,"quoted_status_id_str":"1992512546440630364","quoted_status_permalink":{"display":"x.com/MofaJapan_jp/s…","expanded":"https://twitter.com/MofaJapan_jp/status/1992512546440630364","url":"https://t.co/rtLJHclXdQ"},"reply_count":451,"retweet_count":3750,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"303730149"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwOTY5MjE4MzI1NjE3OTA5NzY=","richtext":{"richtext_tags":[]},"text":"駐日中国大使館は、国連憲章のいわゆる「旧敵国条項」等に関する発信を再び行いました。\n既に先般発信したように、国連憲章のいわゆる「旧敵国条項」については、1995年（平成7年）の国連総会において、時代遅れとなり、既に死文化したとの認識を規定した決議が、圧倒的多数の賛成により採択され、中国自身も賛成票を投じています。また、2005年（平成17年）の国連首脳会合では、国連憲章から「敵国」への言及を削除するとの全加盟国首脳の決意を規定した国連総会決議が採択されており、中国もコンセンサスに加わっています。\n死文化した規定が未だ有効であるかのような発信は、こうした、中国自身が賛成した過去の国連で採択された決議と相容れないものです。\n日本は、戦後一貫して平和国家として国際社会の平和と繁栄に貢献してきています。こうした点は国際社会でも広く認識されています。"}}},"quoted_status_result":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":2},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1082102533454102528/HXpr1ZEl_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/303730149/1782867128"},"core":{"created_at":"Mon May 23 10:17:04 +0000 2011","name":"外務省","screen_name":"MofaJapan_jp"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"VXNlcjozMDM3MzAxNDk=","is_blue_verified":false,"location":{"location":"東京都千代田区"},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":true},"notifications_settings":{"notifications_enabled":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"None","pinned_items":{"tweet_ids_str":["2095650141558768004"]},"possibly_sensitive":false,"privacy":{"protected":false},"profile_bio":{"description":"外務省の公式アカウントです。外交に関する新着情報を中心に発信しております。｜英語版（English）@MofaJapan_en\n｜外務省ソーシャルメディア一覧： https://t.co/2VDfT2CQ5p","entities":{"description":{"urls":[{"display_url":"mofa.go.jp/mofaj/annai/sn…","expanded_url":"https://www.mofa.go.jp/mofaj/annai/sns/list_jp.html","indices":[81,104],"url":"https://t.co/2VDfT2CQ5p"}]},"url":{"urls":[{"display_url":"mofa.go.jp/mofaj/","expanded_url":"http://www.mofa.go.jp/mofaj/","indices":[0,23],"url":"https://t.co/42AYao2vk0"}]}}},"profile_description_language":"ja","profile_image_shape":"Square","profile_metadata":{"profile_interstitial_type":""},"profile_translation":{"translator_type":"none"},"relationship_counts":{"followers":586916,"following":205},"relationship_perspectives":{"blocked_by":false,"blocking":false,"followed_by":false,"following":false,"live_following":false,"muting":false},"rest_id":"303730149","super_follow_eligible":false,"super_followed_by":false,"super_following":false,"tweet_counts":{"media_tweets":20133,"tweets":48790},"verification":{"verified":false,"verified_type":"Government"},"website":{"url":"https://t.co/42AYao2vk0"}}}},"edit_control":{"edit_tweet_ids":["1992512546440630364"],"editable_until_msecs":"1763890584000","edits_remaining":"5","is_edit_eligible":false},"grok_analysis_button":true,"grok_translated_post_with_availability":{"is_available":false},"is_translatable":false,"legacy":{"bookmark_count":4168,"bookmarked":false,"conversation_id_str":"1992512546440630364","created_at":"Sun Nov 23 08:36:24 +0000 2025","display_text_range":[0,45],"entities":{},"favorite_count":84359,"favorited":false,"full_text":"11月21日、駐日中国大使館は、国連憲章のいわゆる「旧敵国条項」に関する発信を行いました。","id_str":"1992512546440630364","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","quote_count":1940,"reply_count":2051,"retweet_count":19832,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"303730149"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5OTI1MTI1NDYzODE5NDY4ODA=","richtext":{"richtext_tags":[]},"text":"11月21日、駐日中国大使館は、国連憲章のいわゆる「旧敵国条項」に関する発信を行いました。\n\n国連憲章のいわゆる「旧敵国条項」については、1995年（平成7年）の国連総会において、時代遅れとなり、既に死文化したとの認識を規定した決議が、圧倒的多数の賛成により採択され、中国自身も賛成票を投じています。また、2005年（平成17年）の国連首脳会合では、国連憲章から「敵国」への言及を削除するとの全加盟国首脳の決意を規定した国連総会決議が採択されており、中国もコンセンサスに加わっています。\n\n死文化した規定が未だ有効であるかのような発信は、国連において既に行われた判断と相容れないものです。"}}},"rest_id":"1992512546440630364","source":"<a href=\"https://mobile.twitter.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter Web App</a>","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"9340766","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}},"rest_id":"2096921832612110833","source":"<a href=\"https://mobile.twitter.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter Web App</a>","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"1334159","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}}},{"entryId":"list-conversation-2097182500219519016-tweet-2096921834596016393","item":{"clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","card":{"rest_id":"https://t.co/ohsN2zGipK"},"cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":2},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1082102533454102528/HXpr1ZEl_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/303730149/1782867128"},"core":{"created_at":"Mon May 23 10:17:04 +0000 2011","name":"外務省","screen_name":"MofaJapan_jp"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"VXNlcjozMDM3MzAxNDk=","is_blue_verified":false,"location":{"location":"東京都千代田区"},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":true},"notifications_settings":{"notifications_enabled":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"N